[ar:Louis G.Alexander]
[ti:43. Hurry Up]
[by:Generated by iChochy]

[00:01.120]Lesson 43 | 第43课
[00:03.990]Can you make the tea, John? | 你能泡茶吗，约翰？
[00:06.190]Yes, of course I can, Mary. | 是的，我当然可以，玛丽。
[00:10.070]Is there any water in this kettle /ˈketl/? | 这个水壶里有水吗？
[00:12.870]Yes, there is. | 是的，有。
[00:15.590]Where's the tea, dear? | 茶叶在哪里，亲爱的？
[00:17.520]It's over there, behind the teapot /ˈtiːpɒt/. | 就在那边，在茶壶后面。
[00:22.910]Can you see it? | 你能看到吗？
[00:24.470]I can see the teapot /ˈtiːpɒt/, but I can't see the tea. | 我能看到茶壶，但我没看到茶叶。
[00:29.340]There it is. | 就在那儿。
[00:31.420]It's in front of you. | 就在你前面。
[00:33.000]Ah, yes, I can see it now /naʊ/. | 啊，是的，我现在看到了。
[00:37.760]Where are the teacups? | 茶杯在哪里？
[00:40.030]There are some in the cupboard. | 碗柜里有一些。
[00:43.340]Can you find /faɪnd/ them? | 你能找到它们吗？
[00:45.090]Yes. | 是的。
[00:46.200]Here they are. | 它们在这里。
[00:48.330]Hurry /ˈhʌri/ up, John! | 快点，约翰！
[00:50.150]The kettle /ˈketl/'s boiling /ˈbɔɪlɪŋ/. | 水壶里的水开了。